Subject: [PATCH] AGC runtime health, bounded flush drain and chunk admission

Adds another conservative runtime wiring pass for AGC alpha. Packet
flush coalescing is now drained at end-of-tick, chunk load/generate
admission delays only new work, and operator diagnostics are exposed via
/agc.

